+# Version Scheme
+
+This project uses semantic versioning (MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH) for its version numbers. The scheme was chosen because it gives package managers and downstream consumers clearer compatibility signals and more predictable dependency resolution: breaking changes are signaled by a MAJOR increment, while MINOR and PATCH increments indicate backward-compatible changes.
